[2026-05-31T15:03:36.518330] [INFO] Node Programmer Code Complete - Event EventType.TOOL_CALL - Tool call read_file_segment for node Programmer Code Complete Details: {'tool_result': {'path': 'evaluator.py', 'encoding': 'utf-8-sig', 'newline': '\n', 'start_line': 4, 'end_line': 18, 'line_count': 40, 'lines_returned': 15, 'total_lines': 18, 'snippet': 'class Evaluator:\n    def __init__(self, model, data_loader):\n        self.model = model\n        self.data_loader = data_loader\n\n    def compute_accuracy(self):\n        correct = 0\n        total = 0\n        with torch.no_grad():\n            for texts, labels in self.data_loader:\n                outputs = self.model(texts)\n                _, predicted = torch.max(outputs.data, 1)\n                total += labels.size(0)\n                correct += (predicted == labels).sum().item()\n        return correct / total', 'truncated': False, 'file_size': 581, 'modified_ts': 1780232606.331088, 'mode': 'line_range'}, 'tool_name': 'read_file_segment', 'success': True, 'result_size': 794, 'arguments': {'path': 'evaluator.py', 'start_line': 4, 'line_count': 40}, 'stage': 'after'} Duration: 0.0032575130462646484
