[2026-05-31T15:05:47.567662] [INFO] Node Programmer Code Review - Event EventType.TOOL_CALL - Tool call read_file_segment for node Programmer Code Review Details: {'tool_result': {'path': 'evaluator.py', 'encoding': 'utf-8-sig', 'newline': '\r\n', 'start_line': 1, 'end_line': 40, 'line_count': 40, 'lines_returned': 40, 'total_lines': 122, 'snippet': '"""\r\r\n\r\r\nThis module evaluates the performance of the TextCNN model.\r\r\n\r\r\n"""\r\r\n    def compute_accuracy(self):\r\r\n        correct = 0\r\r\n        total = 0\r\r\n        with torch.no_grad():\r\r\n            for texts, labels in self.data_loader:\r\r\n                outputs = self.model(texts)\r\r\n                _, predicted = torch.max(outputs.data, 1)\r\r\n                total += labels.size(0)\r\r\n                correct += (predicted == labels).sum().item()\r\r\n        if total > 0:\r\r\n            return correct / total\r\r\n        else:\r\r\n            return 0.0  # or handle it as you see fit\r\r\n        self.model = model\r\r\n\r\r\n', 'truncated': True, 'file_size': 1503, 'modified_ts': 1780232700.334788, 'mode': 'line_range'}, 'tool_name': 'read_file_segment', 'success': True, 'result_size': 948, 'arguments': {'path': 'evaluator.py', 'start_line': 1, 'line_count': 40}, 'stage': 'after'} Duration: 0.0038595199584960938
