[2026-05-31T15:05:47.577873] [INFO] Node Programmer Code Review - Event EventType.TOOL_CALL - Tool call read_file_segment for node Programmer Code Review Details: {'tool_result': {'path': 'textcnn.py', 'encoding': 'utf-8-sig', 'newline': '\r\n', 'start_line': 1, 'end_line': 40, 'line_count': 40, 'lines_returned': 40, 'total_lines': 46, 'snippet': '"""\r\r\nThis module defines the TextCNN architecture for text classification.\r\r\n"""\r\r\nimport torch\r\r\nimport torch.nn as nn\r\r\n\r\r\n    def forward(self, x):\r\r\n        x = self.embedding(x).unsqueeze(1)\r\r\n        x1 = self.conv1(x).squeeze(3)\r\r\n        x2 = self.conv2(x).squeeze(3)\r\r\n        x3 = self.conv3(x).squeeze(3)\r\r\n        x1 = nn.functional.relu(x1)\r\r\n        x2 = nn.functional.relu(x2)\r\r\n        x3 = nn.functional.relu(x3)\r\r\n        x1 = nn.functional.max_pool1d(x1, x1.size(2)).view(x1.size(0), -1)\r\r\n        x2 = nn.functional.max_pool1d(x2, x2.size(2)).view(x2.size(0), -1)\r\r\n        x3 = nn.functional.max_pool1d(x3, x3.size(2)).view(x3.size(0), -1)\r\r\n        x = torch.cat((x1, x2, x3), 1)\r\r\n        x = self.dropout(x)\r\r\n        return self.fc(x)\r\r\n', 'truncated': True, 'file_size': 865, 'modified_ts': 1780232700.3405077, 'mode': 'line_range'}, 'tool_name': 'read_file_segment', 'success': True, 'result_size': 1090, 'arguments': {'path': 'textcnn.py', 'start_line': 1, 'line_count': 40}, 'stage': 'after'} Duration: 0.0047719478607177734
