[2026-05-31T15:07:53.803497] [INFO] Node Programmer Code Review - Event EventType.TOOL_CALL - Tool call read_file_segment for node Programmer Code Review Details: {'tool_result': {'path': 'evaluator.py', 'encoding': 'utf-8-sig', 'newline': '\r\n', 'start_line': 1, 'end_line': 40, 'line_count': 40, 'lines_returned': 40, 'total_lines': 960, 'snippet': '"""\r\nThis module evaluates the performance of the TextCNN model.\r\n"""\r\n\r\nclass Evaluator:\r\n    def compute_accuracy(self, model, data_loader):\r\n        """Compute accuracy of the model on the provided data loader."""\r\n        correct = 0\r\n        total = 0\r\n        with torch.no_grad():\r\n            for texts, labels in data_loader:\r\n                outputs = model(texts)\r\n                _, predicted = torch.max(outputs.data, 1)\r\n                total += labels.size(0)\r\n                correct += (predicted == labels).sum().item()\r\n        return correct / total\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n    def compute_accuracy(self, model):\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n        """Compute the accuracy of the model on the validation set."""\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n', 'truncated': True, 'file_size': 3822, 'modified_ts': 1780232855.8086555, 'mode': 'line_range'}, 'tool_name': 'read_file_segment', 'success': True, 'result_size': 1078, 'arguments': {'path': 'evaluator.py', 'start_line': 1, 'line_count': 40}, 'stage': 'after'} Duration: 0.004483699798583984
