[2026-05-31T15:07:53.808222] [INFO] Node Programmer Code Review - Event EventType.TOOL_CALL - Tool call read_file_segment for node Programmer Code Review Details: {'tool_result': {'path': 'textcnn.py', 'encoding': 'utf-8-sig', 'newline': '\r\n', 'start_line': 1, 'end_line': 40, 'line_count': 40, 'lines_returned': 40, 'total_lines': 803, 'snippet': 'import torch\r\nimport torch.nn as nn\r\nimport torch.nn.functional as F\r\n\r\nclass TextCNN(nn.Module):\r\n    """This module defines the TextCNN architecture for text classification."""\r\n\r\n    def __init__(self, vocab_size, embedding_dim, num_classes):\r\n        super(TextCNN, self).__init__()\r\n        self.embedding = nn.Embedding(vocab_size, embedding_dim)\r\n        self.conv1 = nn.Conv2d(1, 100, (3, embedding_dim))\r\n        self.pool = nn.MaxPool2d((2, 1))\r\n        self.fc = nn.Linear(100, num_classes)\r\n\r\n    def forward(self, x):\r\n        """Forward pass for the TextCNN model."""\r\n        x = self.embedding(x)\r\n        x = x.unsqueeze(1)  # Add channel dimension\r\n        x = self.conv1(x)\r\n        x = F.relu(x)\r\n        x = self.pool(x)\r\n        x = x.view(x.size(0), -1)  # Flatten for the fully connected layer\r\n        return self.fc(x)\r\n        x = x.view(x.size(0), -1)\r\n\r\n        x = self.fc(x)\r\n\r\n        return x\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n    def forward(self, x):\r\n', 'truncated': True, 'file_size': 3572, 'modified_ts': 1780232855.8217134, 'mode': 'line_range'}, 'tool_name': 'read_file_segment', 'success': True, 'result_size': 1325, 'arguments': {'path': 'textcnn.py', 'start_line': 1, 'line_count': 40}, 'stage': 'after'} Duration: 0.0037114620208740234
