[2026-05-31T15:08:09.291635] [INFO] Node Code Reviewer - Event EventType.TOOL_CALL - Tool call read_file_segment for node Code Reviewer Details: {'tool_result': {'path': 'main.py', 'encoding': 'utf-8-sig', 'newline': '\r\n', 'start_line': 1, 'end_line': 40, 'line_count': 40, 'lines_returned': 40, 'total_lines': 3816, 'snippet': '"""\r\nThis is the main module to launch the program.\r\n"""\r\n\r\nfrom torch.utils.data import DataLoader\r\nfrom dataloader import DataLoader\r\nfrom trainer import Trainer\r\nfrom evaluator import Evaluator\r\nfrom textcnn import TextCNN\r\n\r\nif __name__ == \'__main__\':\r\n    # Load data\r\n    data_loader = DataLoader(file_path=\'data.csv\')\r\n    texts, labels = data_loader.load_data()\r\n    # Initialize model, trainer, and evaluator here\r\n    # Train the model and evaluate\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nfrom dataloader import DataLoader\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n', 'truncated': True, 'file_size': 9248, 'modified_ts': 1780232855.815701, 'mode': 'line_range'}, 'tool_name': 'read_file_segment', 'success': True, 'result_size': 891, 'arguments': {'path': 'main.py', 'line_count': 40}, 'stage': 'after'} Duration: 0.0030074119567871094
