[2026-05-31T15:08:09.304060] [INFO] Node Code Reviewer - Event EventType.TOOL_CALL - Tool call read_file_segment for node Code Reviewer Details: {'tool_result': {'path': 'trainer.py', 'encoding': 'utf-8-sig', 'newline': '\r\n', 'start_line': 1, 'end_line': 40, 'line_count': 40, 'lines_returned': 40, 'total_lines': 116, 'snippet': '"""\r\nThis module manages the training process for the TextCNN model.\r\n"""\r\n\r\nimport torch.optim as optim\r\nimport torch.nn.functional as F\r\n\r\nclass Trainer:\r\n    def __init__(self, model, train_loader, val_loader, num_epochs=10):\r\n        self.model = model\r\n        self.train_loader = train_loader\r\n        self.val_loader = val_loader\r\n        self.num_epochs = num_epochs\r\n        self.optimizer = optim.Adam(model.parameters())\r\n\r\n    def train(self):\r\n        """Train the TextCNN model on the training data."""\r\n        for epoch in range(self.num_epochs):\r\n            for texts, labels in self.train_loader:\r\n                self.optimizer.zero_grad()\r\n                outputs = self.model(texts)\r\n                loss = F.cross_entropy(outputs, labels)\r\n                loss.backward()\r\n                self.optimizer.step()\r\n        self.train_loader = train_loader\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n        self.val_loader = val_loader\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n        self.num_epochs = num_epochs\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n        self.optimizer = optim.Adam(model.parameters())\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n', 'truncated': True, 'file_size': 1842, 'modified_ts': 1780232855.826237, 'mode': 'line_range'}, 'tool_name': 'read_file_segment', 'success': True, 'result_size': 1382, 'arguments': {'path': 'trainer.py', 'line_count': 40}, 'stage': 'after'} Duration: 0.0010921955108642578
