[2026-05-31T15:08:48.638631] [INFO] Node Programmer Test Modification - Event EventType.TOOL_CALL - Tool call read_file_segment for node Programmer Test Modification Details: {'tool_result': {'path': 'evaluator.py', 'encoding': 'utf-8-sig', 'newline': '\n', 'start_line': 1, 'end_line': 16, 'line_count': 40, 'lines_returned': 16, 'total_lines': 16, 'snippet': '"""\nThis module evaluates the performance of the TextCNN model.\n"""\n\nclass Evaluator:\n    def compute_accuracy(self, model, data_loader):\n        """Compute accuracy of the model on the provided data loader."""\n        correct = 0\n        total = 0\n        with torch.no_grad():\n            for texts, labels in data_loader:\n                outputs = model(texts)\n                _, predicted = torch.max(outputs.data, 1)\n                total += labels.size(0)\n                correct += (predicted == labels).sum().item()\n        return correct / total\n', 'truncated': False, 'file_size': 555, 'modified_ts': 1780232882.621415, 'mode': 'line_range'}, 'tool_name': 'read_file_segment', 'success': True, 'result_size': 838, 'arguments': {'path': 'evaluator.py', 'start_line': 1, 'line_count': 40}, 'stage': 'after'} Duration: 0.0046994686126708984
