[2026-05-31T15:08:48.671087] [INFO] Node Programmer Test Modification - Event EventType.TOOL_CALL - Tool call read_file_segment for node Programmer Test Modification Details: {'tool_result': {'path': 'textcnn.py', 'encoding': 'utf-8-sig', 'newline': '\n', 'start_line': 1, 'end_line': 23, 'line_count': 40, 'lines_returned': 23, 'total_lines': 23, 'snippet': 'import torch\nimport torch.nn as nn\nimport torch.nn.functional as F\n\nclass TextCNN(nn.Module):\n    """This module defines the TextCNN architecture for text classification."""\n\n    def __init__(self, vocab_size, embedding_dim, num_classes):\n        super(TextCNN, self).__init__()\n        self.embedding = nn.Embedding(vocab_size, embedding_dim)\n        self.conv1 = nn.Conv2d(1, 100, (3, embedding_dim))\n        self.pool = nn.MaxPool2d((2, 1))\n        self.fc = nn.Linear(100, num_classes)\n\n    def forward(self, x):\n        """Forward pass for the TextCNN model."""\n        x = self.embedding(x)\n        x = x.unsqueeze(1)  # Add channel dimension\n        x = self.conv1(x)\n        x = F.relu(x)\n        x = self.pool(x)\n        x = x.view(x.size(0), -1)  # Flatten for the fully connected layer\n        return self.fc(x)\n', 'truncated': False, 'file_size': 823, 'modified_ts': 1780232882.625652, 'mode': 'line_range'}, 'tool_name': 'read_file_segment', 'success': True, 'result_size': 1111, 'arguments': {'path': 'textcnn.py', 'start_line': 1, 'line_count': 40}, 'stage': 'after'} Duration: 0.002000570297241211
